OL,3,GNEWSAHelipad rule change request after
OL,4,Arise in demand
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital trust is seeking to amend
OL,7,Fits helipad planning conditions after
OL,8,Fdemand for air ambulance transfers
OL,9,Fproved higher than expected.
OL,11,FMore than 50 patients have been
OL,12,Fairlifted to the Brighton site since
OL,13,Fthe helipad opened in May after a
OL,14,Fseven-year delay, according to
OL,15,FUniversity Hospitals Sussex NHS
OL,16,FFoundation Trust.
OL,18,FThe facility provides direct access to
OL,19,Fthe Sussex Major Trauma Centre for
OL,20,Fpatients involved in serious road
OL,21,Fcollisions, cardiac emergencies and
OL,22,Fincidents in remote locations.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
