OL,3,GNEWSAHelipad rule change request after
OL,4,Arise in demand
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Duncan Bootland, an emergency
OL,7,Fmedicine consultant and air ambulance
OL,8,Fmedical director, said the helipad was
OL,9,Fproving to be an "invaluable asset" for
OL,10,Fthe county.
